.SH "نسخه (VERSION)"
.IX Header "VERSION"
This document describes \fBautoinst\fR version 20260210.
.SH "RECENT CHANGES"
.IX Header "RECENT CHANGES"
(See the source for the full story, all the way back to 2005.)
.IP \fI2026\-02\-10\fR 12
.IX Item "2026-02-10"
Generated style files now use the \fIfigureversions\fR package
to access superior and inferior figures and fractions,
instead of the (deprecated) \fIfontaxes\fR package.
Added the \fIscriptscale\fR option to the generated style file.
When creating math fonts, we use the font\*(Aqs "mgrk" feature,
if present.
Fixed a few obscure bugs.
.IP \fI2025\-09\-09\fR 12
.IX Item "2025-09-09"
Use the font\*(Aqs WeightClass if its weight cannot be determined
from other metadata (suggested by Christoph L. Spiel).
.IP \fI2025\-08\-25\fR 12
.IX Item "2025-08-25"
Fixed a bug in the processing of the \f(CW\*(C`\-nfssweight\*(C'\fR and
\&\f(CW\*(C`\-nfsswidth\*(C'\fR options.
.IP \fI2025\-08\-19\fR 12
.IX Item "2025-08-19"
Fixed a bug where any fonts with the word "Typewriter"
in their name would be parsed as "Italic".
.IP \fI2025\-07\-02\fR 12
.IX Item "2025-07-02"
The hack in font metadata parsing for Source Serif 4
(See 2025\-01\-07) is also needed for other fonts;
at least for Arno Pro, maybe some other Adobe fonts as well.
So we changed the test again: we apply this hack by default,
except for Libertinus.
.IP \fI2025\-06\-23\fR 12
.IX Item "2025-06-23"
Introduced the "U_" rule for encoding file names.
.IP \fI2025\-04\-16\fR 12
.IX Item "2025-04-16"
Don\*(Aqt load the \fImweights\fR package, as its functionality
is now part of the LaTeX kernel
(and, in fact, has been for a while ...).
.IP \fI2025\-01\-07\fR 12
.IX Item "2025-01-07"
The \*(Aqfix\*(Aq in font metadata parsing that we introduced
for Source Serif 4 was biting Libertinus Serif Display
(and maybe other fonts as well),
so we now test if the family is actually Source Serif 4
before applying that fix.
